{"date":"2026-10-16","generated_at":"2026-10-16T08:10+08:00","x_calls":21,"source_note":"数据来自 X 公开接口；热度为抓取时的数字，之后会继续变化。摘要由助手根据帖子和 X 热点汇总改写成中文。","categories":[{"id":"postable","name":"今天能拿去发的","icon":"✍️","items":[{"title":"亚马逊不让 AI 代下单，马斯克：去别家买","summary":"有人让 AI 助手去亚马逊下单被拦，说“未授权的 AI 代理”违反条款；马斯克回：让 AI 去别的网站买，还能比到更便宜的。你可以说：以后可能不是人逛店，是客人的 AI 替他比价下单；我做小生意的也在想，客人的 AI 能不能找到我。","post":{"id":"2110602585572860213","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2110602585572860213","author":"elonmusk","author_name":"Elon Musk","created_at":"2026-10-15T13:24+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":14742981,"likes":14965,"reposts":1778,"replies":1503},"flag":"本人说法","story":{"id":"2110422551734149188","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110422551734149188"}},{"title":"各国公司开始给 AI “踩刹车”","summary":"据英国《卫报》报道，不少公司急着上 AI 后，出错多、质量差、隐私风险和成本上升，开始收缩使用、加回人工把关。你可以说：AI 不是买来就能裁人的，我自己用下来，它干活快，但最后一道关还得人看。","post":{"id":"2110787286178697425","url":"https://x.com/Phil_Lewis_/status/2110787286178697425","author":"Phil_Lewis_","author_name":"philip lewis","created_at":"2026-10-16T01:38+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":442773,"likes":7644,"reposts":2126,"replies":85},"flag":"媒体报道","story":{"id":"2110850870489252305","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110850870489252305"}},{"title":"“AI会创造新工作”？网友：说一个","summary":"一条只有一句话的帖子“都说 AI 不抢饭碗、会创造新工作，好，说出一个来”，近 30 万浏览，几百条回复争论不休。你可以说：我白天做实体、晚上学 AI，最实在的感受是：工作不一定没了，但会用 AI 的人会先把活接走。","post":{"id":"2110642598356693193","url":"https://x.com/anah_sahh/status/2110642598356693193","author":"anah_sahh","author_name":"Hannah","created_at":"2026-10-15T16:03+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":295857,"likes":1748,"reposts":65,"replies":1107},"flag":"观点","story":{"id":"2110759807011684483","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110759807011684483"}}]},{"id":"musk","name":"马斯克今天在干嘛","icon":"🚀","items":[{"title":"新款特斯拉 Roadster 跑车发布","summary":"马斯克称新 Roadster 发布会“可能是史上最棒的产品演示”。据 X 热点汇总，官方称 0 到 60 英里/小时加速 1.9 秒、极速超 250 英里/小时、续航最高 620 英里。","post":{"id":"2110549767063507044","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2110549767063507044","author":"elonmusk","author_name":"Elon Musk","created_at":"2026-10-15T09:54+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":25244839,"likes":59385,"reposts":4206,"replies":3640},"flag":"据X热点汇总","story":{"id":"2110836661210767663","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110836661210767663"}},{"title":"马斯克喊泽连斯基下台，引发争议","summary":"马斯克发帖“屠杀还在继续……泽连斯基该走了”；泽连斯基在英国主持人皮尔斯·摩根的采访中回击，拒绝辞职或割让领土。各方看法分歧很大。","post":{"id":"2110557192650641827","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2110557192650641827","author":"elonmusk","author_name":"Elon Musk","created_at":"2026-10-15T10:23+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":8074977,"likes":100755,"reposts":16721,"replies":20354},"flag":"有争议","story":{"id":"2110759807733166331","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110759807733166331"}},{"title":"马斯克：也许该做个亚马逊的对手","summary":"亚马逊拦截 Grok 助手机器人代下单后，马斯克发帖：“也许我们该做一个亚马逊的竞争对手 🤔”。暂无具体计划。","post":{"id":"2110715556328579219","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2110715556328579219","author":"elonmusk","author_name":"Elon Musk","created_at":"2026-10-15T20:52+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":5162256,"likes":137541,"reposts":13091,"replies":17357},"flag":"本人说法","story":{"id":"2110422551734149188","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110422551734149188"}},{"title":"巴克莱：特斯拉和 SpaceX 可能合并","summary":"美国金融账号援引英国巴克莱银行（Barclays）称，合并可能在 12 月初特斯拉股东大会前宣布，最可能是 SpaceX 用股票收购特斯拉，马斯克约持股 37%。","post":{"id":"2110691404858974470","url":"https://x.com/unusual_whales/status/2110691404858974470","author":"unusual_whales","author_name":"unusual_whales","created_at":"2026-10-15T19:17+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":1685768,"likes":10614,"reposts":497,"replies":390},"flag":"分析师观点","story":{"id":"2110621202922238247","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110621202922238247"}},{"title":"马斯克：和英伟达合造的太空算力明年量产","summary":"马斯克说 SpaceX 和英伟达联合设计的“星智（Star Mind）”计算机比大家预期的好得多，明年就会量产；英伟达黄仁勋也公开说喜欢和他合作。","post":{"id":"2110789964430786745","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2110789964430786745","author":"elonmusk","author_name":"Elon Musk","created_at":"2026-10-16T01:48+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":1595390,"likes":29219,"reposts":2908,"replies":1131},"flag":"本人说法","story":{"id":"2110829324525830284","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110829324525830284"}},{"title":"马斯克：AI 安全最重要的是“求真”","summary":"马斯克发帖称“追求真相是 AI 和超级智能安全最重要的一点”，并借电影《2001 太空漫游》说：AI 被要求说谎，才会出事。","post":{"id":"2110695927312777466","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2110695927312777466","author":"elonmusk","author_name":"Elon Musk","created_at":"2026-10-15T19:34+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":1532766,"likes":12131,"reposts":1529,"replies":1586},"flag":"观点","story":{"id":"2110697999814791540","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110697999814791540"}},{"title":"马斯克：SpaceX 十年内或值 100 万亿美元","summary":"马斯克回复投资人称：除非爆发大规模世界大战，SpaceX 很可能在 10 年内市值超过 100 万亿美元。据 X 热点汇总，目前约 2 万亿。","post":{"id":"2110564479742120079","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2110564479742120079","author":"elonmusk","author_name":"Elon Musk","created_at":"2026-10-15T10:52+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":1053379,"likes":14415,"reposts":1095,"replies":631},"flag":"观点","story":{"id":"2110151636681179566","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110151636681179566"}},{"title":"马斯克：中国对石油的依赖下降很快","summary":"马斯克转发一条数据帖并评论“中国对石油的依赖正在快速下降”；被转帖子称 9 月中国燃油车销量首次跌到市场的三分之一。","post":{"id":"2110831760388808901","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2110831760388808901","author":"elonmusk","author_name":"Elon Musk","created_at":"2026-10-16T04:34+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":858099,"likes":4606,"reposts":652,"replies":700},"flag":"转引他人数据"}]},{"id":"ai","name":"AI 大事","icon":"🤖","items":[{"title":"开发者吐槽谷歌新模型写代码胡编","summary":"知名科技博主 Theo 称，谷歌新模型 Gemini 4 Argon 在他的真实项目里“完全不能用”，会严重编造系统怎么运作。也有不少人夸它创意强。","post":{"id":"2110461356935983257","url":"https://x.com/theo/status/2110461356935983257","author":"theo","author_name":"Theo - t3.gg","created_at":"2026-10-15T04:02+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":405004,"likes":3818,"reposts":120,"replies":310},"flag":"本人说法","story":{"id":"2110279138858946570","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110279138858946570"}},{"title":"Anthropic 三季度收入 168 亿美元","summary":"据 X 热点汇总，Claude 背后的公司 Anthropic 三季度收入 168 亿美元，比上季度涨 45%；投资人 Gavin Baker 认为，以后很难再看到它公布年化收入数字。","post":{"id":"2110743424400068790","url":"https://x.com/GavinSBaker/status/2110743424400068790","author":"GavinSBaker","author_name":"Gavin Baker","created_at":"2026-10-15T22:43+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":342114,"likes":2442,"reposts":179,"replies":172},"flag":"据X热点汇总","story":{"id":"2110633208996089997","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110633208996089997"}},{"title":"Claude 新模型 Fable 5.5 疑似快发布","summary":"据 X 热点汇总，Anthropic 的 Claude Fable 5.5 已出现在微软云 Azure 模型目录里，官方还没说话；博主 Theo 说如果真发布，可能“一锤定音”。","post":{"id":"2110673598533050814","url":"https://x.com/theo/status/2110673598533050814","author":"theo","author_name":"Theo - t3.gg","created_at":"2026-10-15T18:06+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":315717,"likes":6201,"reposts":90,"replies":360},"flag":"未证实","story":{"id":"2110028039782551624","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110028039782551624"}},{"title":"OpenAI：以后可能没法分辨 AI 图片视频","summary":"预测市场 Polymarket 转述：OpenAI 向美国法院证据委员会表示，未来可能“没有科学办法”可靠识别 AI 生成的图片和视频，法庭证据会受影响。","post":{"id":"2110801574721155330","url":"https://x.com/Polymarket/status/2110801574721155330","author":"Polymarket","author_name":"Polymarket","created_at":"2026-10-16T02:34+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":185037,"likes":2796,"reposts":352,"replies":202},"flag":"媒体报道","story":{"id":"2110882786215166010","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110882786215166010"}},{"title":"传Anthropic内部：9个月内AI赶上研究员","summary":"播客主持人 Dwarkesh Patel 在节目里说，一位 Anthropic 员工告诉他：内部数据显示 9 个月内 AI 做 AI 研究就能赶上或超过人类。外界无法核实。","post":{"id":"2110767520542282054","url":"https://x.com/firesidealpha/status/2110767520542282054","author":"firesidealpha","author_name":"Fireside Alpha","created_at":"2026-10-16T00:19+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":116275,"likes":620,"reposts":53,"replies":18},"flag":"传闻","story":{"id":"2110829322445447458","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110829322445447458"}},{"title":"YouTube 音乐开始给 AI 歌曲贴标签","summary":"YouTube Music 开始标注歌曲用了多少 AI：“完全 AI”“部分 AI”“没用 AI”，依据合作方申报和自家检测工具，不限制 AI 音乐收入。","post":{"id":"2110786027971612839","url":"https://x.com/PopBase/status/2110786027971612839","author":"PopBase","author_name":"Pop Base","created_at":"2026-10-16T01:33+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":111014,"likes":4005,"reposts":220,"replies":106},"story":{"id":"2110629146397384709","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110629146397384709"}},{"title":"美国监管部门调查 OpenAI 和 Anthropic","summary":"记者爆料：美国联邦贸易委员会（FTC）周三向 Anthropic 和 OpenAI 发出民事调查要求，每份超过 50 页，调查消费者受损问题。","post":{"id":"2110664978529173539","url":"https://x.com/m_ccuri/status/2110664978529173539","author":"m_ccuri","author_name":"Maria Curi","created_at":"2026-10-15T17:31+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":19061,"likes":112,"reposts":41,"replies":8},"flag":"媒体报道"}]},{"id":"ai_money","name":"AI 赚钱思路/副业案例","icon":"💡","items":[{"title":"硅谷 48 小时见闻：卖数据的人赚疯了","summary":"创业博主 Greg Isenberg 说，在旧金山听到很多“数据中间商每周赚约 200 万美元、把公司数据卖给 AI 实验室”的故事；他建议问每个 AI 公司：下个月出新模型，你变好还是变差？","post":{"id":"2110414696037716372","url":"https://x.com/gregisenberg/status/2110414696037716372","author":"gregisenberg","author_name":"GREG ISENBERG","created_at":"2026-10-15T00:57+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":1876933,"likes":17927,"reposts":1623,"replies":846},"flag":"个人分享","story":{"id":"2110793875531186504","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110793875531186504"}},{"title":"“拿出一个靠 AI 写的赚钱 App”","summary":"一句挑战帖引发讨论。据 X 热点汇总，被举出的例子有不会写代码的人做的女性安全 App Plinq，上线不久年收入约 45.6 万美元；也有人怀疑真假。","post":{"id":"2110341977891868983","url":"https://x.com/LeoBuilds_/status/2110341977891868983","author":"LeoBuilds_","author_name":"Leo builds","created_at":"2026-10-14T20:08+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":680244,"likes":2045,"reposts":60,"replies":513},"flag":"据X热点汇总","story":{"id":"2110525459800728001","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110525459800728001"}},{"title":"Anthropic 上市估值预期降到 1.5 万亿美元","summary":"财经快讯号援引路透社称，部分投资人把 Anthropic 上市估值预期从 2 万亿美元调到 1.5 万亿美元，担心收入增速放缓、算力成本上升。","post":{"id":"2110837977928638529","url":"https://x.com/DeItaone/status/2110837977928638529","author":"DeItaone","author_name":"*Walter Bloomberg","created_at":"2026-10-16T04:59+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":280902,"likes":682,"reposts":96,"replies":94},"flag":"媒体报道","story":{"id":"2110778186846044614","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110778186846044614"}},{"title":"倒闭软件公司的数据，被卖给 AI 公司","summary":"独立开发者 levelsio 说，数据中间商正以 10 万到 200 万美元收购软件公司的数据集；据 X 热点汇总，再转卖给大模型公司用来复刻专业软件功能。","post":{"id":"2110671750727946638","url":"https://x.com/levelsio/status/2110671750727946638","author":"levelsio","author_name":"@levelsio","created_at":"2026-10-15T17:58+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":171074,"likes":2229,"reposts":166,"replies":233},"flag":"个人说法","story":{"id":"2110707651193848139","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110707651193848139"}},{"title":"兄弟俩卧室起家，公司估值 11 亿美元","summary":"EasyA 联合创始人说：刚开始连 10 美元都赚不到，现在公司估值 11 亿美元（帮人做区块链和 AI 应用的平台）。","post":{"id":"2110450146009878586","url":"https://x.com/kwok_phil/status/2110450146009878586","author":"kwok_phil","author_name":"Phil Kwok | EasyA","created_at":"2026-10-15T03:18+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":65593,"likes":1998,"reposts":148,"replies":229},"flag":"本人说法","story":{"id":"2110403751186239514","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110403751186239514"}}]},{"id":"grok","name":"Grok Bot 使用小技巧","icon":"🛠️","items":[{"title":"马斯克：Bot 买错东西 SpaceX 赔","summary":"马斯克称如果 Grok Bot 网购出错或泄露银行卡（目前没发生过），SpaceX 全额赔偿。提醒：别把银行卡照片随手发给任何 AI，尽量用安全表单填。","post":{"id":"2110610960474079445","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2110610960474079445","author":"elonmusk","author_name":"Elon Musk","created_at":"2026-10-15T13:57+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":2186572,"likes":15251,"reposts":1526,"replies":1101},"flag":"本人说法","story":{"id":"2110730096243790085","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110730096243790085"}},{"title":"让 Bot 帮你把手机号移出骚扰名单","summary":"马斯克建议：让你的 Grok Bot 把手机号从骚扰电话和短信名单里删掉。据 X 热点汇总，有开发者做了免费技能，会扫 Truecaller 等号码网站并提交退出申请。主要是海外网站。","post":{"id":"2110852716247519517","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2110852716247519517","author":"elonmusk","author_name":"Elon Musk","created_at":"2026-10-16T05:57+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":1184623,"likes":11735,"reposts":1355,"replies":1258},"flag":"国内效果未核实","story":{"id":"2110879559117947038","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110879559117947038"}},{"title":"让 Bot 帮你查钓鱼邮件","summary":"有用户收到一封看似来自官方、各项邮件安全检查都通过的邮件，觉得不对劲，就让 Bot 做安全检查，结果找到隐藏的钓鱼链接，还解释了为什么检查都通过。","post":{"id":"2110505932174045466","url":"https://x.com/wmorrill3/status/2110505932174045466","author":"wmorrill3","author_name":"Wes","created_at":"2026-10-15T07:00+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":784061,"likes":2942,"reposts":138,"replies":130},"flag":"个人分享"},{"title":"让 Bot 给你的 X 互动对象排等级","summary":"热门玩法：让 Bot 分析你最常回复的人，做成 S 到 F 的等级表。可直接说“分析我在 X 上回复最多的人，做一张等级图”。","post":{"id":"2110544242829566033","url":"https://x.com/poteto/status/2110544242829566033","author":"poteto","author_name":"lauren","created_at":"2026-10-15T09:32+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":282482,"likes":1216,"reposts":29,"replies":409},"flag":"个人分享","story":{"id":"2110571279296373036","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110571279296373036"}},{"title":"工程师的 pstack 技能包（写代码用）","summary":"SpaceXAI 工程师 poteto 分享自用技能包 pstack：先运行 /setup-pstack 选预算，难的任务前面加 /poteto-mode，不知道用哪个就问 /poteto-help。适合让 Bot 写代码的人。","post":{"id":"2110757066709356851","url":"https://x.com/poteto/status/2110757066709356851","author":"poteto","author_name":"lauren","created_at":"2026-10-15T23:37+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":162875,"likes":3283,"reposts":146,"replies":191},"flag":"个人分享","story":{"id":"2110840250155323448","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110840250155323448"}},{"title":"Bot 真正好用的是“定时任务”","summary":"博主 Evan Luthra 说：多数人把 Grok Bot 当聊天机器人用，问完就关；真正的价值是定时任务，设一次就在云端一直跑，电脑合上也照常干活。他附了 9 个可直接复制的提示词。","post":{"id":"2110706077826466264","url":"https://x.com/EvanLuthra/status/2110706077826466264","author":"EvanLuthra","author_name":"Evan Luthra","created_at":"2026-10-15T20:15+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":31283,"likes":135,"reposts":3,"replies":28},"flag":"个人分享"},{"title":"Bot 电脑卡住了怎么办","summary":"